{% render 'suiji-r107-home-guide' %}
{% render 'suiji-r107-home-care' %}
<section class="r-split suiji-home-founder" data-modules="8"><figure><img data-image-slot="home-about" src="{{ 'suiji-designer-chunyu-wen-v40.jpeg' | asset_url }}" data-photo-origin="chunyu-portrait" alt="Portrait of Chunyu Wen, founder of SUIJI" width="1230" height="1672" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Chunyu Wen, founder of SUIJI</figcaption></figure><div><p class="r-eyebrow">Made with intention</p><h2>From a childhood curiosity to SUIJI.</h2><p>Chunyu’s story began with a childhood game: looking for gemstones at the mine where she was born. Years later, her bespoke fine jewelry work, begun in 2014, brought another discovery: the many ways people wanted to wear a favorite design. SUIJI grew from those conversations.</p><p>Our approach to sustainability begins with continued use: keep a base, change a compatible charm and give a favorite piece more days to be worn.</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/about#designer' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Meet Chunyu<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/care-guide#materials' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Materials &amp; care<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></div></section><section class="r-split r-split--ice r-split--text" data-modules="9,10,11"><div><p class="r-eyebrow">AI Charm Studio</p><h2>Let the next charm begin with your idea.</h2><p>A co-creation experience in preparation. Explore the examples and try the local workspace: describe an idea, choose an image, or bring both together.</p><a class="r-button" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/design-studio' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Explore AI Charm Studio<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></div></section><section class="r-section " id="journal"><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Notes for the pieces you wear</h2></div><aside class="r-reading"><p class="r-eyebrow">A useful next read</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/blogs/journal/grandes-boucles-oreilles-legeres' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Large lightweight earrings: 9 checks before you buy<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/blogs/journal/ornament-base-compatibility' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Will this ornament fit my SUIJI base?<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/blogs/journal/personal-jewelry-design-brief' | replace: '//', '/' }}">How to write a custom jewelry brief a maker can use<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></aside><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/blogs/journal' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Read the Journal<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></section><section class="r-section " id="newsletter"><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Keep in touch</h2></div><p>Occasional notes on new pieces, craft and more ways to wear what you love.</p><div data-native-newsletter>{% form 'customer', id: 'R107Newsletter', class: 'r-newsletter-form' %}<input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter"><label>Your email<input type="email" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" required></label><button class="r-button" type="submit">Subscribe</button><label class="r-newsletter-consent"><input type="checkbox" name="contact[accepts_marketing]" value="true" required><span>I would like to receive SUIJI news by email. I can unsubscribe at any time.</span></label>{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p role="status">Thank you for subscribing. Check your inbox for any confirmation email.</p>{% elsif form.errors %}<div role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{% endif %}{% endform %}<a class="r-caption" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/policies/privacy-policy' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Privacy & choices</a></div></section></div>
{%- endif -%}
